{"sections":[{"slug":"可逆层","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"可逆层"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">可逆层</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“可逆层”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的光滑代数簇</span>, $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的可逆层是指秩为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的局部自由</span> $\\mathcal{O}_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">可逆层在张量积下构成</span> Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $\\operatorname{Pic}(X)$. <span lang=\"zh\">给定</span> Weil "},{"Local":{"url":"/除子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">除子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $D=\\sum_Y n_Y [Y]$, <span lang=\"zh\">构造可逆层</span> $\\mathcal{O}_X(D)$ <span lang=\"zh\">如下</span>:\n$$\r\n\\mathcal{O}_X(D)(U)=\\{f\\in K^\\times : \\forall Y, Y\\cap U\\neq\\varnothing \\Rightarrow v_Y(f)+n_Y\\geq 0\\}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $D\\mapsto \\mathcal{O}_X(D)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为同态</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}